Scribrism includes a local four-class inference adapter informed by the
published model architecture example for:

- wasitaigeneratedcom/ai-text-detector-small, revision
  f1795c86806e6838d4afa33d0b1427f8430c9615 (Apache-2.0 declaration).

The adapter has been modified for pinned local loading, explicit tensor
loading, complete overlapping-window coverage, validation and local reporting.
Model weights, tokenizers, research corpora and third-party library packages
are not included in this source distribution.

